  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f100" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Balance Sheet - The Company does not directly own tangible property. Rather, the Company&amp;#8217;s pipeline transportation services are provided through the use of pipeline capacity leased from affiliated companies, including Arrowhead Gathering Company, LLC, Arrowhead Eagle Ford Pipeline, LLC and Arrowhead Ingleside Pipeline, LLC. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;2.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;None&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;3.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company does not have any employees. All of the company management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Harvest Midstream.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;4.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;N/A&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;5.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company does not pay federal or state income taxes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;6.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;N/A&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
